  "abstract": "LN variant capacity sweep on proj_rank p from 32 to 40 with hidden size H=96. Keeps \u03b3_end=0.99, residual copy, MAE+curvature, and V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5). Optimizer unchanged (Adam) to isolate p effect.",
